<title>USA: Abrams ups payout, sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Abrams ups payout, sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abrams Industries Inc said Friday its board has increased its quarterly dividend to $0.04 per share from $0.02 per share and declared a one-time dividend of $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>The company said both dividends will be paid June 27 to shareholders of record on June 16.</p>
<p>The declaration coincided with the release of Abrams' improved 1997 fourth quarter and year-end earnings.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
